<title>USA: BT Financial Q3 net falls after charge.</title>
<headline>BT Financial Q3 net falls after charge.</headline>
<dateline>JOHNSTOWN, Pa. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statement of Income</p>
<p>			  SEPTEMBER 30, 1996</p>
<p>		(in thousands, except shares and per share data)</p>
<p>				THREE MONTHS ENDED  NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>				   9/30/96  9/30/95  9/30/96  9/30/95</p>
